    "body": "If you're referring to the fact that I'm not passing a document into check popover validity here, its because we should continue to hide the popover if the popover's document gets changed.\r\nWhile implementing this in chromium, I naively passed the document to check popover validity but it made the browser crash because the popover wasn't fully hidden and some top layer stuff was left in a bad state.",
